cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  vyakti-judge-qual: a judge-qualification protocol, harness and
  backtest corpus for LLM-as-a-judge on affective preference tasks
message: >-
  If you use this suite or its data, please cite the accompanying
  paper. Please also read DATASHEET.md: the ground truth here is
  LLM-produced, not human-annotated, and agreement with it is not
  accuracy.
type: dataset
